Provenance: this is the license text embedded by Thmanyah Publishing and Distribution
inside every font file in this directory (OpenType `name` table, nameID 13 "License
Description" -- extract it yourself with `fonttools ttx -t name thmanyahsans-Regular.woff2`
to verify). It is not the SIL Open Font License that the other families under
apex/public/vendor/ ship under; Thmanyah is a separate, proprietary license.

The embedded record carries both an Arabic original and this English translation
together, and the license's own LANGUAGE clause states the Arabic version prevails
over any translation in case of conflict. The Arabic original is reproduced nowhere
in this repository's source tree by policy; it remains available, unchanged, inside
each vendored font file above, exactly as the vendor shipped it, and can be recovered
from there with the same `fonttools` command whenever the authoritative text is
needed.

